{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Fall Cat</strong>: a game where you play as a cat, who is immortal...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Plot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fall Cat has you fall down an <u>endless</u> building, with you attempting to <u>survive as long as possible</u>. Don't worry about causing harm to the cat, he's immortal and has nothing better to do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge flower pots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge bricks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect hearts to regain health and boost your score</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four <strong><u>awesome</u></strong> songs (Composed by Calvin &quot;Yellow Flare&quot; Chan)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And a little <u><i><strong>secret...</strong></i></u></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Extra Information</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is <u>pretty short</u>, and is meant to be a easy game to just pick up and play! Attempt to boost your score each time you play, possibly run into that little <u><i><strong>secret</strong></i></u>, and jam out to the sound track with surprisingly intense gameplay.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3709460?t=1768160884","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709460/b5efec58dd36d46570cafc9b85759d926497a0ee/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768160884","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709460/96af0ebdc7bd6495894cdd882d32ac93ec6ed412/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768160884","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709460/96af0ebdc7bd6495894cdd882d32ac93ec6ed412/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768160884","ca